+//
+// FREEZE: multi-agent / tab-lease / host_computer chrome gates live HERE.
+// Do NOT re-inflate createToolExecutor with this block.
+// Cookie/URL → tool/url-cookie-admission.ts; L2 → tool/l2-admission.ts;
